      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The [`vDSP_hann_window`](vdsp_hann_window.md) and [`vDSP_hann_windowD`](vdsp_hann_windowd.md) functions create a Hann window vector using the following operation:",
      "normalizedSource": "The [`vDSP_hann_window`](vdsp_hann_window.md) and [`vDSP_hann_windowD`](vdsp_hann_windowd.md) functions create a Hann window vector using the following operation:",
      "sourceHash": "7de0d531c15e1aae10f7ad5baade30fbf7756d7d345eb6c57e05ae7545fc69e7",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nIf Flag & vDSP_HALF_WINDOW:\n    Length = (N+1)/2;\nElse\n    Length = N;\n\nIf Flag & vDSP_HANN_NORM:\n    W = .8165;\nElse\n    W = .5;\n\nfor (n = 0; n < Length; ++n)\n    C[n] = W * (1 - cos(2*pi*n/N));\n```",
      "documentTitle": "vDSPhannwindow",
      "framework": "Accelerate",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0009:0001",
      "blockId": "code:discussion:0009",
      "type": "preserve",
      "source": "```swift\nIf Flag & vDSP_HALF_WINDOW:\n    Length = (N+1)/2;\nElse\n    Length = N;\n\nIf Flag & vDSP_HANN_NORM:\n    W = .8165;\nElse\n    W = .5;\n\nfor (n = 0; n < Length; ++n)\n    C[n] = W * (1 - cos(2*pi*n/N));\n```",
      "normalizedSource": "```swift If Flag & vDSP_HALF_WINDOW: Length = (N+1)/2; Else Length = N; If Flag & vDSP_HANN_NORM: W = .8165; Else W = .5; for (n = 0; n < Length; ++n) C[n] = W * (1 - cos(2*pi*n/N)); ```",
      "sourceHash": "fb1a63f7ba0eed404615ca889f81c6b7eb906c81e6899f635d17756c3fcc7ac1",
      "translatable": false,
      "preserveReason": "code",
      "contextBefore": "The [`vDSP_hann_window`](vdsp_hann_window.md) and [`vDSP_hann_windowD`](vdsp_hann_windowd.md) functions create a Hann window vector using the following operation:",
      "contextAfter": "Use [`vDSP_vmul`](vdsp_vmul.md) to multiply the Hann window result by a noninteger-periodic signal prior to a Fourier transform.",
      "documentTitle": "vDSPhannwindow",
      "framework": "Accelerate",
      "ko": "```swift\nIf Flag & vDSP_HALF_WINDOW:\n    Length = (N+1)/2;\nElse\n    Length = N;\n\nIf Flag & vDSP_HANN_NORM:\n    W = .8165;\nElse\n    W = .5;\n\nfor (n = 0; n < Length; ++n)\n    C[n] = W * (1 - cos(2*pi*n/N));\n```",
      "status": "preserved",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": true
    },
