      "normalizedSource": "Use [`vDSP_vmul`](vdsp_vmul.md) to multiply the Hann window result by a noninteger-periodic signal prior to a Fourier transform.",
      "sourceHash": "523707bfea1142a8e297aa8cabac17ce063a8ea7e98aa13c9142d92592e0feb9",
