      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The following code shows how to generate a Hann window:",
      "normalizedSource": "The following code shows how to generate a Hann window:",
      "sourceHash": "fa439bee82c2730da8c1659ae4ef3da2df7f3ed3ab6c5bbdeaf4ebc45fe1592e",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Use [`vDSP_vmul`](vdsp_vmul.md) to multiply the Hann window result by a noninteger-periodic signal prior to a Fourier transform.",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nlet n = vDSP_Length(1024)\nvar c = [Float](repeating: 0,\n                count: Int(n))\n\nvDSP_hann_window(&c,\n                 n,\n                 Int32(vDSP_HANN_DENORM))\n```",
